        "fallbackBehavior": "Liquity falls back from Chainlink to Tellor when the Chainlink call fails, returns invalid data, is more than four hours stale, or moves by more than 50% between consecutive updates; the PriceFeed contract retains a last-good price across oracle status transitions.",
